      "content": "i know people say it's temporary but it doesn't feel like that. it feels permanent. like the social part of me just... expired. i feel like i'm just playing a character of myself now to keep up appearances, but it's exhausting. i'm just going through the motions of a life that doesn't even feel real anymore. wouldn't it be easier if i just didn't have to pretend?",
